<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Champion Enterprises.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Champion Enterprises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it downgraded Champion Enterprises Inc to market outperform and removed the stock from its &quot;Recommended List.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Separately, on Thursday Champion Enterprises said its second quarter earnings could fall below the $0.39 a share reported a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Champion Enterprises lost 1-7/8 to 13-7/8.</p>
</text>
